\subsection{Cross-Scale Analysis}
\label{sec:cross_scale}

The four-model evaluation reveals a sharp dissociation between scale effects under different trace conditions (Table~\ref{tab:cross_model}).
Under \texttt{no\_trace}, accuracy shows strict scale monotonicity: 67.31\% (Qwen-1.5B) $<$ 73.36\% (DeepSeek-6.7B) $<$ 75.13\% (Qwen-7B) $<$ 76.50\% (CodeLlama-13B), spanning 9.19pp.
