\section{DebugBench Full Results}
\label{sec:debugbench_full}

Full per-category results on DebugBench \citep{tian2024debugbench} (426 samples: 142 logic, 142 reference, 142 syntax bugs).
\texttt{exception\_only} achieves 100\% on all three categories.
VOTA's single error is a logic bug; \texttt{no\_trace}'s 14 errors distribute as: 8 logic, 4 reference, 2 syntax.

